{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n こんにちは。\n 櫻坂46の井上梨名です。\n \n \n \n \n \n 先日、松平璃子の卒業が発表されました。\n \n \n \n \n \n すごくすごく寂しいです。\n \n \n \n \n 同期が卒業する時は、行ってらっしゃい！おめでとう！っていう気持ちで笑顔で見送りたいと思っていました。\n \n \n \n けど、やっぱり寂しさが勝ってしまって璃子に、\n \n \n \n 寂しいよ。卒業しないで。って言ってしまいます。\n \n \n \n \n もっと一緒に活動したかったっという気持ちが溢れてきます。\n \n \n \n \n 同期からの卒業。\n 早いよ、って思ったりもしたけど時間は関係なくて、本人の強い意志次第なんだなとも思ったり。\n \n \n \n 璃子が、これからは私がみんなの1番のファンだからね！って言ってくれました。\n \n \n \n 私も璃子の決めた道を全力で応援します。\n \n \n \n \n 卒業したらもう会えないってわけじゃないけど、\n 残りの一緒に活動できる時間を大切にして、おめでとう。いってらっしゃい。って言えたらいいなって思います。\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKV1TK8ZB2ATVD69SNPCBX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKV30PX04P0QVKM19HXT1C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKV42H5W6MHWN52VJM9S2M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKV55GB7J521ND3GCSKG52","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKV6882Y87JXZRTBS4BVPZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKV7A6RST7GBCZW6M24KT4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKV8J9XNWKYZ161M684EK8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKV9M30DKNQQBG79TNZ3XP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKVAMXSDGM36CCK64TMJKW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n それでは今日はこの辺で、\n \n \n \n \n 最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます。\n \n \n \n \n ばいば〜い🦒             "}],"source":"archive"}